5,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Greetings, everyone. It is a pleasure to be in your company. Let us approach this challenge with calm hearts and open minds, supporting one another as we seek the truth together.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Misaki,,Hello. I agree with Servas. Let's keep things logical and observe each other's behavior carefully since we have no information yet.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,May,,"Hello everyone! I'm looking forward to this. Let's keep it lively, but I'll be keeping a very close eye on all of you to see who's hiding something. This should be fun!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,Good evening. I agree with the sentiment of calm and logic. Let us observe the flow of conversation and see what patterns emerge as we get to know one another.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Yay! A mystery game! I'm so excited to find the werewolf! I'm going to be the best detective ever and save the village! Let's have lots of fun, everyone!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,"It is wonderful to see such youthful energy from Sakura and May. While enthusiasm is a gift, let us remember that patience is often the key to uncovering the truth. What do you all think?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"I agree with Servas. While energy is fine, we shouldn't rush into accusations without evidence. For now, I think it's best to just listen and see how everyone expresses themselves.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,May,,"Patience is fine, but a little intuition goes a long way, don't you think? I'm not rushing, but I'm definitely enjoying the tension. Let's see who starts acting nervous first!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"Intuition can be a useful guide, May, but it is often a fickle one. I believe a balanced approach—combining your intuition with Misaki's logic—will serve us best in the days to come.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""May"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Sakura,,A balanced approach? That sounds like something a teacher would say! Hehe! I'll use my super-duper intuition and my detective eyes to spot the werewolf! I'm ready for anything!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,"Hehe, Sakura, your spirit is truly infectious. Let us simply enjoy this moment of peace before the mysteries unfold. I shall spend this time listening to the harmony of your voices.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"I think we've established a good baseline for today. Since there's no voting yet, I'll just continue to observe. I'm curious to see how the dynamics shift once the first night passes.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,May,,"I'm with Misaki on that. The real game starts when the masks begin to slip. Until then, I'll just be here, enjoying the view and wondering which one of you is the little wolf in sheep's clothing!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I find myself in agreement. For now, there is no need for haste. I shall simply enjoy the quiet of this first evening and reflect on our initial impressions.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"Me too! I'm just going to imagine what the werewolf looks like! Maybe they have big scary teeth? Hehe! I'm going to keep watching everyone very, very closely!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Servas,,"As the day draws to a close, let us carry this spirit of kindness into the night. May we all sleep peacefully, and may the truth reveal itself to us in the morning.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
