34,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all rested well. The air feels different today, as the time for observation gives way to the time for discovery. Does anyone have any insights to share with us?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"Good morning. I'm still observing, but I'm interested to see if the Seer has any information. If anyone has a lead, please share it so we can analyze it logically.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,May,,"Morning, everyone! I'm wide awake and ready. @Misaki, you're so formal! Come on, let's get to the good part. Seer, if you've found something spicy, don't keep us waiting! Who's the lucky wolf?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Good morning. I have used my divination last night to check May. I can confirm that May is human. While this doesn't identify the werewolf, it provides us with a reliable starting point for our trust.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Whoa! Jonathan is the Seer! That was so fast! @May, you're lucky! Now we know you're a good person, so you have to help me find the werewolf with my detective eyes! This is getting so exciting!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Servas,,"It is a blessing to have a clear starting point. Thank you for your guidance, Jonathan. May, since you have been confirmed as human, your intuition may now be a valuable asset to us all.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Jonathan, revealing yourself so early is a bold move. While confirming May is helpful, we should consider if this is a strategy to gain trust quickly. Does anyone else find this timing a bit suspicious?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, you're always so cautious! It's a bit boring, isn't it? I'm flattered that Jonathan chose me, and honestly, it makes things much more interesting. Why be suspicious when we can just move forward?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Misaki, I understand your caution. However, providing a confirmed human early on creates a foundation of trust that can protect the village from unnecessary confusion. I prefer a path of transparency over one of hidden games.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Misaki, you're being a party pooper! Why be suspicious when Jonathan is being so helpful? I think it's super cool that he told us right away! It's like a shortcut to winning! Hehe!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Servas,,"It is natural for Misaki to be cautious; it is a sign of a sharp mind. However, let us not let suspicion cloud our spirit. If we trust Jonathan's word, we move forward together in light.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"I'm not trying to be a party pooper, Sakura. I'm simply weighing the risks. If Jonathan is the werewolf pretending to be the Seer, he's just bought himself and May a lot of trust. We should remain vigilant.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Jonathan"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,May,,"@Misaki, you're really stuck on that ""what if,"" aren't you? It's a bit exhausting! If Jonathan were the wolf, why waste a turn confirming me? It's much more fun to just trust him and see where this leads. Don't be such a killjoy!","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Misaki, your vigilance is a necessary part of this game, and I do not take offense to it. However, the risk of losing a day of divination is greater than the risk of my deception. I ask for your trust as we proceed.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Misaki, you're still worrying! If we spend all our time worrying, the werewolf will just laugh at us! Hehe! I believe Jonathan! Let's just trust him and go on a big werewolf hunt together! Who's with me?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Servas,,"The time for debate is drawing to a close. While Misaki's caution is a shield, trust is the bridge that allows us to cross this river. I believe we should trust Jonathan's guidance for now. Let us vote with a peaceful heart.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"I still have my doubts, but I cannot ignore the consensus. If the majority is willing to trust Jonathan's claim, I will follow for now. However, I'll be watching closely to see if his future results hold up.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
51,1,4,pass,Misaki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
52,1,4,talk,May,,"Finally, Misaki is coming around! See, it's much more fun when we just go with the flow. Since we have no one to execute today, I'll just keep my eyes peeled for any weird vibes.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
53,1,4,pass,May,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
54,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I appreciate your willingness to trust me, Misaki. It is the most rational path forward for the village. Since we have no evidence to act upon today, I suggest we skip the execution to preserve our numbers.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
55,1,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
56,1,4,talk,Sakura,,I agree! Let's not kick anyone out yet! It's like a secret mission where we wait for the perfect moment to pounce! Hehe! I'm going to keep my detective eyes wide open tonight!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
