71,2,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a heavy morning. We have lost May, and Misaki has been wounded in the night. Such a sudden turn of events reminds us that the wolf is truly among us, hiding in the shadows of our trust.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""May"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"It is indeed a tragedy. May was confirmed human, yet she was executed due to a sudden shift in voting. This loss is a blow to our numbers and our morale. We must now be even more careful with our trust.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"Wait, what?! May is gone?! That's so sad! I can't believe we did that! My detective eyes must have been sleepy! Who would do such a mean thing to a confirmed human? This is a total disaster!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,2,talk,Servas,,"It is a painful lesson in how easily we can be led astray when we let our hearts wander. We must not dwell on the regret, but instead use this sorrow to sharpen our resolve. Jonathan, as our guide, what did your divination reveal last night?","{""words"":46,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I divined Servas last night, and the result was clear: Servas is human. We now have two confirmed humans among us, which narrows the possibilities significantly. We must rely on this certainty to find the wolf.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"Wow! Servas is a good person too! That's great news! Now we have Jonathan, May—oh, wait, May is gone—and Servas! That means the werewolf is either Misaki or me! But I'm a detective, so it must be Misaki! Hehe!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Jonathan"",""May"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,3,talk,Servas,,"It is a comfort to know we can trust one another, but Sakura, let us not be too hasty in our conclusions. Misaki has suffered an attack, which often suggests the wolf wishes to remove her from the board.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Sakura, please be careful with your conclusions. While the numbers are narrowing, we must remember the existence of the Possessed, who appears human to the Seer. Misaki being attacked is a strong signal, but not definitive proof of her innocence.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"Possessed? What's that? A secret helper for the wolf? That's so sneaky! But if Misaki was attacked, maybe the wolf is just trying to trick us into thinking she's a good person! Hehe, the wolf is really clever!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,2,4,talk,Servas,,"Indeed, the wolf is a master of deception. However, we must look at the heart of the matter. Misaki's caution yesterday was a gift to us, and her injury today is a heavy burden. Let us be gentle and thoughtful.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
81,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"We must weigh the evidence carefully. Misaki's attack suggests she is a target, but the Possessed could be manipulating the situation. However, with Servas confirmed human, the circle of suspicion is very small. Let us decide our path with composure.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
82,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"I'm thinking really hard now! If Jonathan and Servas are good, and Misaki was attacked, it's like a big puzzle! Maybe the wolf is just pretending to be mean to Misaki to trick us! Hehe, this is the most exciting mystery ever! Who should we vote for?","{""words"":47,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Servas"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
